      {
        "name": "compose_edit",
        "description": "Purely update a Design draft operation after removing one attachment. Does not invoke models, mutate documents or load media. Indices refer to the current ordered attachment list; remainingAttachmentIndices must equal that list minus attachmentIndex. Returns context:null for an inseparable or no-longer-valid operation, otherwise the updated opaque context and retained old indices. Only for the application composer.",
