      {
        "name": "text_extract",
        "description": "Recognize actual text in one image layer with the configured image-understanding model. Returns texts (at most 128 regions with server-assigned markers and original text up to 2000 characters), a same-size PNG marked with red boxes/numbers, and sourceLayerId/sourceAssetId/sourceCrop (null if uncropped). Cropped layers are recognized and marked at the effective crop size. No readable text returns an empty texts array and still returns the marked PNG. Use markedAsset.id, sourceAssetId as expectedSourceAssetId, sourceCrop as expectedSourceCrop, and the returned originals in edit-text; do not invent markers. May incur provider charges; closing the editor does not cancel accepted work.",
        "inputSchema": {
